# The build context is uploaded in full before anything is built, so anything large and
# reproducible stays out of it. A first attempt walked serving/.venv-live, several
# gigabytes of installed wheels that the image installs for itself anyway, and the upload
# was still going long after the build should have finished.
**/.venv
**/.venv-*
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
.git
v1
utils/transformers
runtime/artifacts
**/*.pyc
**/*.log
